+        // reverse beside it, so live converts defer loaded regions instead of
+        // copying files under live writes.
+        // Open-but-clean handles stay undetected; shadow protection is the backstop.
+        // Skip via core isFolderDirty (tracked-dirty defers; never-tracked proceeds).
+        net.linear.LinearRegionConverter.linear$setForwardSkipPredicate(path -> {
